From 0f301cc750612847896a10feb4ee1da0f437d09f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 11:29:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] link integrity: fix CTA misdirection at the writer, add
 generic detection, plan the Arena
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root cause (fleet): hero/call-to-action URL fields carried schema source
pages.contact / pages.services — a literal name lookup written into
resolved_data unconditionally on every render, silently reverting any
authored retarget (75/75 + 68/69 CTA instances across 8/10 sites ->
/contact.html).

Go (one chassis image):
- resolve_internal_links: chooseCTATargets v2 ranks interactive (tool/game)
  pages ahead of section-index hubs; setCTAField also writes
  *_target_title so copy can be authored for the actual destination;
  ctaExcludedDestination fixes the firstPathSegment blind spot for
  top-level pages like /contact.html
- rerender_page_sections: CTA recompute gated strictly on
  reason=cta_links_stale, with an exception rule that keeps authored
  real/non-excluded/non-circular links — the no-LLM repair path for
  already-deployed pages
- create_rerender_items: stamp spec.reason for cta_links_stale without
  component scoping
- render_site_components: validate the header CTA against real pages,
  fall back to chooseCTATargets instead of rendering a phantom
- new checks: misdirected_cta (anchor text names page X, href goes to Y ->
  page_rerender/cta_links_stale; distinctive text naming no page with a
  bad href -> cta_names_unknown_destination, human review) and
  incomplete_page_group (plan-promised siblings part-deployed; tool/game
  gaps to human review per TP-004)
- orphan_pages: nav-flagged tool pages are no longer excluded, so missing
  nav entries for tools surface as nav_drift
- datahelpers: ExtractAnchors (href + visible text), shared by the checks

SQL (docs/social001_vonc_tiktok_social/minilobby_task, apply per RUNBOOK):
- 091 flip the four CTA url sources pages.* -> renderer (fleet, backed up,
  verified)
- 092 enable phantom_internal_links + the two new checks on
  completeness-discovery-agent; accept cta_links_stale in page-rerender;
  append *_target_title writer guidance
- 093 vonc: fix the two /how-it-works* phantoms in prose components (the
  19 misdirected CTAs repair through the generic cta_links_stale path)
- 094 vonc: plan tool-arena + queue tool-generator item + PLAN doc
- 095 vonc: retarget arena-naming CTAs once the Arena page is deployed
  (pre-flight enforced)

Tests: unit coverage for the anchor extractor, token matcher, ranking,
exclusion helper and recompute exception rule; actions/discovery_checks/
datahelpers suites green. Pre-existing unrelated failure in
orchestration_test.go (NewSagaCoordinator signature drift) untouched.

